          "title": "about the project",
          "task": "This is going to be a simple 3D game engine, a merge of Unreal Unity and Godot with some design principals belonging to one or the other and a melding of the Three. My style is simple PSX style horror games so this engine will be geared towords that. For now we will work in \u0027main\u0027 and focus on the very very basics, before moving into more strucutres sub systems via branches\r\n\r\nLanguage Used should be C\u002B\u002B",
