          "title": "Basic scripting",
          "task": "We need to maintain a \u0022dictionary\u0022 of types for various systems to look up. it should provide data on type names, child methods, parameters, etc for auto complete. \r\n\r\nCreating a script adds a new type and component to the system. All scripts will inherit from Actor but can be edited to inherit from Actor2D or Actor3D or anything else that already inherits from Actor (including custom scripts). Doing this comes with text completion.\r\n\r\nattached is a sample cScript of what it should look like.",
